=3eabcef73b41045a41e0167a2463e73e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1f54b2dc/uploads/origins/7f68a7b0-cd7a-4bc2-abb4-e8e318d34935?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3eabcef73b41045a41e0167a2463e73e, https://si.imgix.net/1f54b2dc/uploads/origins/7f68a7b0-cd7a-4bc2-abb4-e8e318d34935?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=24c4eff96a0d4480cd7211a4395773ed 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1f54b2dc/uploads/origins/7f68a7b0-cd7a-4bc2-abb4-e8e318d34935?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a86ce3511ff3aafb18d825b8213a2ac4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/94", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/64c8ce54/uploads/origins/63d35c03-6a29-42ee-8188-b633fcf0082f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cacc06f9ac07fb5222c15c1c346a2dfc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/64c8ce54/uploads/origins/63d35c03-6a29-42ee-8188-b633fcf0082f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cacc06f9ac07fb5222c15c1c346a2dfc, https://si.imgix.net/64c8ce54/uploads/origins/63d35c03-6a29-42ee-8188-b633fcf0082f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=940ed300386ed92adf37bf828e6a517e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/64c8ce54/uploads/origins/63d35c03-6a29-42ee-8188-b633fcf0082f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3bafd1eec45dbb1729f6140153d51a1a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "你好！能画我的原创角色娜奥米和露西亚吗？参考图：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16JU43v3h8cz6l74uJPwL-jVpOn5X5OPP?usp=sharing\n\n娜奥米拥有红发、硕大阳具，比露西亚更高挑且胸围更丰满。她是露西亚的女友，也是唯一能让露西亚在欢愉中彻底放纵的人。露西亚黑发如墨，平日性情乖戾，但每次交欢时终究会乞求娜奥米的阳具。具体姿势和参考图由你决定，只需确保其中一个变体包含大量精液。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/93", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c47c227f/uploads/origins/c94e4d36-2bfb-4a37-b8ba-4971d9794b9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e325ae7283918705cd1ad5c90d514ef4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c47c227f/uploads/origins/c94e4d36-2bfb-4a37-b8ba-4971d9794b9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e325ae7283918705cd1ad5c90d514ef4, https://si.imgix.net/c47c227f/uploads/origins/c94e4d36-2bfb-4a37-b8ba-4971d9794b9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ce4c207c97855e22ef38789bb7cb80b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c47c227f/uploads/origins/c94e4d36-2bfb-4a37-b8ba-4971d9794b9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=62e9928b490c777bea9add2af904e9c1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "你能画出《蓝档案》里的小坂若叶和柴犬以传教士体位发生性行为吗？我想看到狗和若叶的连接处。最好画几张图，一张是插入的画面，另一张是狗背对着她并和她交配（若叶的姿势不必改变）。\n参考图：类似左侧女孩：https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/139156261", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/92", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f7925115/uploads/origins/2672694a-3b62-43d8-af46-dbf5d82a92bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5288c970de43d099e4ebd1f2bfdc67fe", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f7925115/uploads/origins/2672694a-3b62-43d8-af46-dbf5d82a92bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5288c970de43d099e4ebd1f2bfdc67fe, https://si.imgix.net/f7925115/uploads/origins/2672694a-3b62-43d8-af46-dbf5d82a92bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1077368374a2f73f00891baa22191456 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f7925115/uploads/origins/2672694a-3b62-43d8-af46-dbf5d82a92bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e60b23891a65cf663f9f862ada2355a8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "你好，你的画风非常可爱，我想请你画我的角色。你可以使用文件夹里的任何服装。请画她被掐住脖子同时接受肛交的场景，并让精液从她的阴道里滴落。你也可以画另一个变体：当她的屁股被内射时正在高潮。请从掐住她并和她发生性关系的人的视角来绘制。谢谢！\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Pj8vn-vcEWYxrQEfa0NnPifJw9qY-DNH?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/91", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/54a77780/uploads/origins/c4044bc5-2a1f-47d1-a42f-d1bd5741c023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3ac70d2f0f1b6d46e95b3d634b03e462", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/54a77780/uploads/origins/c4044bc5-2a1f-47d1-a42f-d1bd5741c023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3ac70d2f0f1b6d46e95b3d634b03e462, https://si.imgix.net/54a77780/uploads/origins/c4044bc5-2a1f-47d1-a42f-d1bd5741c023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7f62d053b889e7a2ef93e44cabb22a5b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/54a77780/uploads/origins/c4044bc5-2a1f-47d1-a42f-d1bd5741c023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=be0cba58db710fdac879edfbdb704d1f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/90", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/51e45448/uploads/origins/fa7cda5c-d2af-43ba-8597-59484c56f2f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b