精时拼命摆动臀部。此外，麻美应该只穿着围裙，下面什么都不穿。\n\n\nGwelatin ref：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1yS3oAwfvatmxlP-Zp9hHnEEJhN_33hp-?usp=sharing\n\n感谢您阅读我的请求", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/88", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/16d66cd4/uploads/origins/287f9ff6-095d-4266-a11e-87faca0ae8f3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a978e0ff6a0b8b6a29f42a0c5d47b088", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/16d66cd4/uploads/origins/287f9ff6-095d-4266-a11e-87faca0ae8f3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a978e0ff6a0b8b6a29f42a0c5d47b088, https://si.imgix.net/16d66cd4/uploads/origins/287f9ff6-095d-4266-a11e-87faca0ae8f3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=46af6ff8a3625ce33ce402dcc8b22c1e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/16d66cd4/uploads/origins/287f9ff6-095d-4266-a11e-87faca0ae8f3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0778cd5143248159e23f18e889c8f4f3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "你好，我是 Seiran Aichi。谢谢你的帮助\n\n我想再委托您为我的原创人物阿露埃特绘制一幅性爱插图，但这次我希望您能以漫画的形式绘制，每幅两到三页。\n\n请点击这里查看该角色的资料。\n资料 1.\n(https://x.com/urapanSKB/status/1653029691517976577)\n文件 2\n(https://x.com/urapanSKB/status/1725212404878098914)\n\n请保持与您之前绘制的以下要求中的衣服相同。或者，您也可以将头部部分留在漫画中间，让她全裸！\n(https://x.com/seiranaichi/status/1991443020424835123?s=46&t=CKJ0Q1Z6AoRT86bK_dQRLQ)\n(https://x.com/seiranaichi/status/1978796199982649401?s=46&t=CKJ0Q1Z6AoRT86bK_dQRLQ)\n\n至于整体流程，请按以下要求完成\n第 1 页 → 从介绍到插入\n第 2 页至第 3 页 → 行为过程中--Nakadashi，事后精液溢出的描述。\n\n请参考以下各页插图。这只是一个粗略的图像，如果您能以方便原岚爱一绘制的方式进行创作，我们将不胜感激。\n\n第 1 页\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/132287604\n\n第 2 页。\n我们希望您自由绘制一幅您以各种姿势做爱的图片。\n\n第 3 页。\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/100295545\n* https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/127282768\n\n这是一个详细的请求，但如果您能在第 1 页和第 3 页之间的某个地方加入关于接吻的描述就更好了.....！\n\n这些是请求的细节。我们知道您很忙，但还是希望您能考虑一下。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/87", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/23fdf14c/uploads/origins/bf81ff54-f914-4574-a879-8f5c0838296b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b71546e085d5066e7aeaa046bf4df7d0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/23fdf14c/uploads/origins/bf81ff54-f914-4574-a879-8f5c0838296b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b71546e085d5066e7aeaa046bf4df7d0, https://si.imgix.net/23fdf14c/uploads/origins/bf81ff54-f914-4574-a879-8f5c0838296b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a037331dc4b6b2d673a1c68b0df82c1a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/23fdf14c/uploads/origins/bf81ff54-f914-4574-a879-8f5c0838296b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=763f387683a8df7c4c8b1d75aedda7c4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/86", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cd7ad78d/uploads/origins/74b6bb5e-7855-4016-85e2-19b12b3cedbe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=70ef5bd0decb9f40c16ea40c28a71509", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cd7ad78d/uploads/origins/74b6bb5e-7855-4016-85e2-19b12b3cedbe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=70ef5bd0decb9f40c16ea40c28a71509, https://si.imgix.net/cd7ad78d/uploads/origins/74b6bb5e-7855-4016-85e2-19b12b3cedbe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a6cfb822ca09c76a8480f5aada281986 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cd7ad78d/uploads/origins/74b6bb5e-7855-4016-85e2-19b12b3cedbe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=50e5381d09a3be6577c5b3f00f788e61 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/85", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/537b7b99/uploads/origins/038da866-0546-46a2-b21d-3c1660d80048?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4458f483e4f8ce54beb2666fdcbbd44", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/537b7b99/uploads/origins/038da866-0546-46a2-b21d-3c1660d80048?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4458f483e4f8ce54beb2666fdcbbd44, https://si.imgix.net/537b7b99/uploads/origins/038da866-0546-46a2-b21d-3c1660d80048?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ab599365f1d824ce4818bf819ab27a95 2x, https://si.imgix.net/537b7b99/uploads/origins/038da866-0546-46a2-b21d-3c1660d80048?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2453ac3d55b86e15fb4a8bba5cd7a5e6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "又见面了。我想请求创作《Granblue Fantasy》中莱莉娅的漫画。这将是上次请求的续集。\n\n故事情节是，莉雅再次遇到狼，害羞地向狼展示自己的阴部，期待狼继续舔舐。狼给了她一个问候式的舔舐，莉雅非常享受，但当狼停下来绕到她身后时，莉雅感到困惑。莉雅蹲下并张开阴部，希望引诱狼继续舔。\n\n狼却把丽雅推倒，骑在她身上。当狼用它那犬科大阴茎拍打她的阴部和腹部时，莉雅感到震惊和恐慌，因为它未能插入而沮丧地挺动着。\n\n莉雅试图爬开，但这样做会使她的阴部角度更适合插入。狼胜利地嚎叫着夺走了丽雅的贞操。狼会让莉雅成为它的交配母狗。最后，莉雅被精液灌满，发出淫荡的尖叫。\n\n参考资料\nhttps://catbox.moe/c/i4boj3\n\n其他细节由您自行决定。\n感谢您的考虑。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/84", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/891b8c0f/uploads/origins/203e9517-3967-4f74-95ab-e4d26cba9